      <a href="https://www.lexisnexis.co.uk/legal/news/hm-land-registry-publishes-guidance-on-new-reporting-rules-for-contractual-control-rights"><span class="k">LexisNexis</span><strong>HMLR publishes guidance</strong><span>News note on the spatial-data requirement and identity details.</span></a>
